# 统一行尾：仓库内与检出后一律 LF
# 目的：避免在 Windows（core.autocrlf=true）提交/检出时把 \r 带进 shell 脚本，
#       导致 Linux 上 `bash deploy/deploy.sh` 报 "$'\r': command not found"。
* text=auto eol=lf

# shell 脚本必须是 LF
*.sh text eol=lf

# Windows 批处理保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.tar.gz binary
